"t01" [shape=box style=rounded label="1. GOCC management to GOCC board: Proposed COB" tooltip="15a-01"]
"t02" [shape=box style=rounded label="2. GOCC board to GOCC management: Board\napproval" tooltip="15a-02"]
"t03" [shape=box style=rounded label="3. GOCC management to DBM: COB on or before 31\nMarch, with DBM Forms 700, 703-A to 703-C,\n705, 706" tooltip="15a-03"]
"t04" [shape=box style=rounded label="4. DBM: Evaluate: uses agree with the board\napproval, sources cover uses, national\npriorities, physical performance, use of last\nyear's budget, financial ratios" tooltip="15a-04"]
"t05" [shape=box style=rounded label="5. DBM to GOCC management: COB approval letter\n(within 20 working days)" tooltip="15a-05"]
"t06" [shape=box style=rounded label="6. GOCC management to DBM: Request for subsidy\nor equity in the national budget proposal" tooltip="15a-06"]
"t07" [shape=box style=rounded label="7. Congress to DBM: GAA item \"Budgetary\nSupport to Government Corporations\"" tooltip="15a-07"]
"t08" [shape=box style=rounded label="8. GOCC management to DBM: Special Budget\nRequest. The amount must be in the board-\napproved COB" tooltip="15a-08"]
"t09" [shape=box style=rounded label="9. DBM to BTr: Release document" tooltip="15a-09"]
"t10" [shape=box style=rounded label="10. BTr to GOCC management: Cash released\ndirectly to the corporation" tooltip="15a-10"]
"tau1" [shape=box width=0.15 height=0.15 style=filled fillcolor="#444444" label="" tooltip="skip: The corporation owes the Treasury"]
"t11" [shape=box style=rounded label="11. BTr: Offset the release against dividends\ndue, guarantee fees, advances and other\nreceivables" tooltip="15a-11"]
"tau2" [shape=box width=0.15 height=0.15 style=filled fillcolor="#444444" label="" tooltip="end of: The corporation owes the Treasury"]
"t12" [shape=box style=rounded label="12. GOCC management to BTr: Dividends: at\nleast 50 percent of annual net earnings" tooltip="15a-12"]
"t13" [shape=box style=rounded label="13. GOCC management to DBM: Quarterly\nfinancial and physical reports through URS,\nwithin 30 days after each quarter. Also\npublished on its website" tooltip="15a-13"]
"t14" [shape=box style=rounded label="14. GOCC management to Congress: Written\nnotice that the reports were submitted and\npublished" tooltip="15a-14"]
"t15" [shape=box style=rounded label="15. GOCC management to COA: Year-end financial\nstatements by 14 February" tooltip="15a-15"]
"t16" [shape=box style=rounded label="16. COA to GOCC board: Audit report" tooltip="15a-16"]
"t17" [shape=box style=rounded label="17. GCG to GOCC board: Performance targets and\nevaluation of the corporation" tooltip="15a-17"]
